  "ingredients": [
    "8 ounce bacon",
    "1/2 medium onion",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1/4 cup white wine",
    "1 1/2 cup heavy cream",
    "1/2 cup grated parmesan cheese (plus more for garnish)",
    "16 ounce spiralized zucchini",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all ingredients. Dice the onion.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-alfredo-zoodles-with-bacon/#wprm-recipe-53833-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Alfredo-Zoodles-with-Bacon-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook the bacon on both sides until the slices are crispy. Place the cooked bacon on a paper towel and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-alfredo-zoodles-with-bacon/#wprm-recipe-53833-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Alfredo-Zoodles-with-Bacon-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "With the bacon fat in the pan, add the diced onion. Cook the onion until translucent.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-alfredo-zoodles-with-bacon/#wprm-recipe-53833-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Alfredo-Zoodles-with-Bacon-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the garlic to the pan. Mix together well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-alfredo-zoodles-with-bacon/#wprm-recipe-53833-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Alfredo-Zoodles-with-Bacon-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add white wine to the pan and cook until half the wine is absorbed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-alfredo-zoodles-with-bacon/#wprm-recipe-53833-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Alfredo-Zoodles-with-Bacon-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add heavy cream to the pan and bring it to a boil. Once boiled, lower the heat to low.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-alfredo-zoodles-with-bacon/#wprm-recipe-53833-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Alfredo-Zoodles-with-Bacon-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the parmesan cheese into the pan. Stir until combined well and cook until sauce starts to get thick, about 1-3 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-alfredo-zoodles-with-bacon/#wprm-recipe-53833-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Alfredo-Zoodles-with-Bacon-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the spiralized zucchini to the pan and toss everything together well. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-alfredo-zoodles-with-bacon/#wprm-recipe-53833-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Alfredo-Zoodles-with-Bacon-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chop the bacon into bite sized pieces. Put the zoodles in a bowl and top with bacon pieces and parmesan cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-alfredo-zoodles-with-bacon/#wprm-recipe-53833-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
